3. Requests the Governments of the area to continue
                    to co-operate with the Director of the Agency in seeking and carrying out
                    projects capable of supporting substantial numbers of refugees;

5. Approves a relief budget of $25,100,000 and a
                    rehabilitation budget of $36,200,000 for the fiscal year ending 30 June
                    1955;

8. Requests the Negotiating Committee for
                    Extra-Budgetary Funds, after receipt of such budgets from the Director of UNRWA,
                    to seek such funds as may be required by the Agency;
